<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<!-- The one shared container (2026-10-19, factory job 002). The extension only READS the
	     plugin purchase the app recorded here (PluginUnlock.recordedOwned): extensions may not
	     sell (App Review 4.4) and Apple does not support StoreKit inside them. Apple's profiles for
	     com.echoelmusic.app.auv3 grant this group: build 10008 signed with it (run 39341933847), and
	     the signing probe of 2026-10-21 (run 39647016707) printed it in the development and the App
	     Store profile. Signing is settled, launching is not: the legacy extension signed fine and
	     failed in the host with -3000. If the plugins return -3000 in AUM, remove this key first
	     (factory job 002, criterion 6). The same profiles also grant group.com.echoelmusic; the
	     extension does not ask for it, because nothing in it reads the earlier app's songs. -->
	<key>com.apple.security.application-groups</key>
	<array>
		<string>group.com.echoelmusic.shared</string>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
